TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Dur! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Şimdiden açtın, değil mi, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}
?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:000A:}}Bunu seninle
birlikte yapmak istemiştim!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}What? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}You opened it? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}And you
don't have what was inside?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I thought I could count on you.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¿Cómo? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}La has abierto... {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¡y encima
